    "summary": "Close the implementation gap between spec 080's design and what actually shipped. Move GitHub from statecraft-direct OAuth to Rauthy's upstream IDP, remove the imaginary admin-mint JWT endpoint, drive custom claims through Rauthy's scope + user-attribute model, and resolve org memberships through a layered strategy — GitHub App installation token first, per-user PAT second, with fail-loud if neither is available.\n",
